{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"0ead43409ef640bba1a11aa81ea1f717","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"87caea9fa0c7da415aab261a262330d0a770","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=87caea9fa0c7da415aab261a262330d0a770","view_num":239,"pub_timestamp":"1709802253","title":"3월 7일 업데이트 개선사항","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=87caea9fa0c7da415aab261a262330d0a770","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"1df44a2486dff743e1671190754b0d80\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[모바일\u0026amp;PC\u0026nbsp;공통\u0026nbsp;개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;보이는\u0026nbsp;이펙트를\u0026nbsp;조절할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;설정-그래픽\u0026nbsp;메뉴에\u0026nbsp;[전투\u0026nbsp;이펙트]\u0026nbsp;항목에서\u0026nbsp;설정할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;전투에서\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;SR과\u0026nbsp;RL\u0026nbsp;무기의\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;충전량이\u0026nbsp;UI에\u0026nbsp;정확하게\u0026nbsp;반영되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;성능은\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;바라보고\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;니케의\u0026nbsp;명중률이\u0026nbsp;자율\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;시의\u0026nbsp;명중률로만\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;아레나에서\u0026nbsp;RL\u0026nbsp;무기의\u0026nbsp;히트\u0026nbsp;이펙트가\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;아레나에서\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;보호막\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;작동하지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;폴크방\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「스타팅\u0026nbsp;휘슬」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;폴크방\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「스플린트」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;에테르\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「초거대\u0026nbsp;단세포」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;아리아\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「아리아\u0026nbsp;디\u0026nbsp;캄포」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;티아\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「도마뱀의\u0026nbsp;보호」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;엄폐물\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;회복\u0026nbsp;효과에\u0026nbsp;화살표\u0026nbsp;표시를\u0026nbsp;제거하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;효과는\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;엄폐물\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;회복\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;▲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[변경]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;엄폐물\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;회복\u0026nbsp;n%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;랩쳐의\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명에\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;효과에\u0026nbsp;대한\u0026nbsp;설명을\u0026nbsp;추가하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;효과는\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;정보\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;정보가\u0026nbsp;표시되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;니케가\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;카메라\u0026nbsp;흔들림이\u0026nbsp;표현되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e10.\u0026nbsp;스톰브링어의\u0026nbsp;보호막\u0026nbsp;이펙트가\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e11.\u0026nbsp;설정에서\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;위치를\u0026nbsp;변경할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;시간이\u0026nbsp;표시되는\u0026nbsp;위치가\u0026nbsp;좌,\u0026nbsp;우\u0026nbsp;일치하도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e12.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;PVE\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;스테이지를\u0026nbsp;자율\u0026nbsp;전투로\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;빈\u0026nbsp;공간을\u0026nbsp;향해\u0026nbsp;사격하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e컨텐츠/시스템\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;레벨업\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;수량\u0026nbsp;선택\u0026nbsp;버튼이\u0026nbsp;활성화되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;대원모집\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;영상이\u0026nbsp;깜빡이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;레이드의\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;복사\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;복사한\u0026nbsp;스쿼드가\u0026nbsp;즉시\u0026nbsp;갱신되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;시간이\u0026nbsp;임박하면\u0026nbsp;로비의\u0026nbsp;대원모집\u0026nbsp;버튼\u0026nbsp;위에\u0026nbsp;잔여\u0026nbsp;시간이\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드\u0026nbsp;도전\u0026nbsp;모드에서\u0026nbsp;셀렉트\u0026nbsp;링\u0026nbsp;패턴\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;패턴\u0026nbsp;카운트다운\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;유저\u0026nbsp;프로필\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;테두리\u0026nbsp;전시\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;꾸미기\u0026nbsp;메뉴에\u0026nbsp;검색\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;스탠딩과\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;컷씬을\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;이름으로\u0026nbsp;검색할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;상세정보와\u0026nbsp;패스\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;니케가\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;자연스러운\u0026nbsp;위치에\u0026nbsp;출력되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e9\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;협동작전에서\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;유저의\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬을\u0026nbsp;투표로\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;투표가\u0026nbsp;시작된\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;5초\u0026nbsp;이내에\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;많은\u0026nbsp;투표를\u0026nbsp;받은\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;사용됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;각\u0026nbsp;스킬의\u0026nbsp;득표수가\u0026nbsp;같을\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;상단에\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;사용됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;투표에\u0026nbsp;참여한\u0026nbsp;인원의\u0026nbsp;과반수\u0026nbsp;이상으로부터\u0026nbsp;득표한\u0026nbsp;스킬은\u0026nbsp;즉시\u0026nbsp;사용됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;투표가\u0026nbsp;초기화될\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있으며,\u0026nbsp;이\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;재투표가\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능\u0026nbsp;튜토리얼이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;캠페인\u0026nbsp;3-1\u0026nbsp;노멀\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;진입을\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;랩쳐와\u0026nbsp;조우\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;튜토리얼이\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e모든\u0026nbsp;유저가\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능을\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;대상을\u0026nbsp;확장하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;2-12\u0026nbsp;노멀\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;해금됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;트라이브\u0026nbsp;타워와\u0026nbsp;기업\u0026nbsp;타워의\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;스테이지가\u0026nbsp;확장되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;트라이브\u0026nbsp;타워\u0026nbsp;스테이지가\u0026nbsp;450층에서\u0026nbsp;550층으로\u0026nbsp;확장됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;기업\u0026nbsp;타워\u0026nbsp;스테이지가\u0026nbsp;400층에서\u0026nbsp;500층으로\u0026nbsp;확장됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터에서\u0026nbsp;긴급\u0026nbsp;탈출을\u0026nbsp;할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;무한로딩이\u0026nbsp;발생하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터에서\u0026nbsp;포탈\u0026nbsp;위에\u0026nbsp;오브젝트를\u0026nbsp;내려놓을\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;20섹터에서\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;발판\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;스쿼드가\u0026nbsp;강제로\u0026nbsp;포탈에\u0026nbsp;탑승하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터의\u0026nbsp;전투력이\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;적용된\u0026nbsp;스테이지를\u0026nbsp;포함한\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;스테이지의\u0026nbsp;전투력이\u0026nbsp;하향\u0026nbsp;조정되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;버프\u0026nbsp;레거시에\u0026nbsp;저장할\u0026nbsp;버프가\u0026nbsp;없는\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;안내\u0026nbsp;메시지가\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;필드에서\u0026nbsp;유실물을\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;쉽게\u0026nbsp;찾을\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;유실물\u0026nbsp;탐색\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;다음\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;루키\u0026nbsp;아레나의\u0026nbsp;그룹\u0026nbsp;재편성이\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일(수)\u0026nbsp;05:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;21일(목)\u0026nbsp;04:59:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e19\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;진행을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;필드에\u0026nbsp;변화가\u0026nbsp;있을\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;해당\u0026nbsp;변경\u0026nbsp;사항을\u0026nbsp;안내하는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[기존\u0026nbsp;필드\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;적용\u0026nbsp;대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;OVER\u0026nbsp;ZONE\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;MIRACLE\u0026nbsp;SNOW\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;Bunny\u0026nbsp;X\u0026nbsp;777\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;어색한\u0026nbsp;위치에\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e21.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e버스트\u0026nbsp;게이지\u0026nbsp;충전\u0026nbsp;속도\u0026nbsp;증가\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;RL\u0026nbsp;무기에\u0026nbsp;적용되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;캠페인\u0026nbsp;스테이지에서\u0026nbsp;마더웨일과\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;소환된\u0026nbsp;랩쳐를\u0026nbsp;공격할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없었던\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e기타\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;기기에서\u0026nbsp;타이틀\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;영상이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;유실물\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;사용성을\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;패키지\u0026nbsp;상품의\u0026nbsp;구성품이\u0026nbsp;3개를\u0026nbsp;초과할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;구성품\u0026nbsp;아이콘이\u0026nbsp;겹쳐져\u0026nbsp;모두\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;시나리오의\u0026nbsp;음성이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;업적\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;개수가\u0026nbsp;달성\u0026nbsp;목표인\u0026nbsp;업적이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;기기에서\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;애니메이션의\u0026nbsp;과도하게\u0026nbsp;잘려보이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;로마자\u0026nbsp;입력으로\u0026nbsp;일본어와\u0026nbsp;한자(간체)를\u0026nbsp;조합하기\u0026nbsp;어려운\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[PC\u0026nbsp;개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;환경에서\u0026nbsp;설정\u0026nbsp;-\u0026nbsp;그래픽\u0026nbsp;메뉴의\u0026nbsp;[항상\u0026nbsp;위]\u0026nbsp;옵션을\u0026nbsp;활성화한\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;재실행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;해당\u0026nbsp;옵션이\u0026nbsp;적용되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;환경에서\u0026nbsp;필수\u0026nbsp;업데이트가\u0026nbsp;존재할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;표시되는\u0026nbsp;안내\u0026nbsp;문구를\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;자연스럽게\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_cd5908cc6d51b6883819a910e2df8de5f3e6f202-1200x675-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.jpeg"],"ext_info":"{\"template_id\":\"\"}","jump_link":{},"content_desc":"3월 7일 업데이트 개선사항","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"[모바일\u0026PC 공통 개선사항]\n전투 관련 개선사항：\n1. 전투 중 보이는 이펙트를 조절할 수 있는 기능이 추가되었습니다.\n└ 설정-그래픽 메뉴에 [전투 이펙트] 항목에서 설정할 수 있습니다.\n2. 전투에서 간헐적으로 SR과 RL 무기의 차지 충전량이 UI에 정확하게 반영되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n└ 실제 성능은 기존과 동일합니다.\n3. 전투 중 바라보고 있는 니케의 명중률이 자율 전투 시의 명중률로만 적용되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n4. 아레나에서 RL 무기의 히트 이펙트가 출력되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n5. 아레나에서 일부 보호막 스킬이 작동하지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n[대상]\n└ 폴크방 스킬1 「스타팅 휘슬」\n└ 폴크방 버스트 스킬 「스플린트」\n└ 에테르 버스트 스킬 「초거대 단세포」\n└ 아리아 버스트 스킬 「아리아 디 캄포」\n└ 티아 버스트 스킬 「도마뱀의 보호」\n6. 스킬 설명 중 엄폐물 체력 회복 효과에 화살표 표시를 제거하였습니다.\n└ 실제 효과는 기존","language":"ko","father_content_id":"87caea9fa0c7da415aab261a262330d0a770","result":0}}